                          </p>
                          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                            <?php echo ruiyi_translate(
                              'Los productos marcados como buffet se mostrarán con precio €0.00 y solo se enviarán a la cocina sin cargo',
                              'Products marked as buffet will display €0.00 price and only be sent to kitchen without charge',
                              '标记为自助餐的产品将显示€0.00价格，只发送到厨房不产生费用'
                            ); ?>
                          </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                          <button type="button" onclick="openBuffetModal()"
                                  class="px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fas fa-edit"></i>
                            <?php echo ruiyi_translate('Editar productos Buffet', 'Edit Buffet Products', '编辑自助餐产品'); ?>
                          </button>
                          <script>
